  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01567",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": " 菅原道真流放中诗云：“蓂发桂芳半具圆，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "During his exile, Sugawara no Michizane wrote in a poem: \"The calendar plant blooms, the cassia gives off fragrance, and the moon is half full,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01567",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "三千世界一周天。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "it circles once through the heavens over the three thousand worlds.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01567",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "天迥玄鉴云将霁，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The sky is far away, and around the dark mirror the clouds are about to clear,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01567",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "只是西行不左迁。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "it is only going west, not being demoted and exiled.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01567",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "见《菅家后草》。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This appears in Kanke Koshu.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01567",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "此乃汉诗，非译文。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This is a Chinese-style poem, not a translation.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01567",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "末句之意：月亮只是自动向西行而已，并非像我那样被流放。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The meaning of the final line is that the moon is merely moving west of its own accord, and has not been exiled as I have.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p01567",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "以下源氏诗即取此意。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The following Genji poem draws on this meaning.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
